# Kept beside the harness so it runs, never committed:
# the FaceGen of the two fixture NPCs is Bethesda's own (copied out of the game's BSAs; local use only),
# and the game shortcut is machine-specific (absolute target, volume label and computer name inside the .lnk).
fixtures/**/facegendata/
harness/SKSE-NPCSelection.lnk
__pycache__/
# validation/.gitignore keeps generated *.json out of the repository; the bench's JSON files are its records and
# inputs (corpus table, manifest, settings snapshot, fixture recipe), so they are committed.
!*.json
